  "articleBody": "A garage can become a permitted bedroom when the design addresses zoning, replacement parking, insulation, ventilation, natural light, electrical and plumbing work, and emergency escape. In San Diego County, the exact requirements vary by city and property; a coordinated design-build team can review existing conditions, prepare plans, manage permit steps, and build the finished room.",
